{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lean Left, Lean Right\u00a0\u2014\u00a0Without pressing any keys!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiltility\u2122 uses your webcam to transform your body movement into game controls. Bind your tilt to keys, and dominate without lifting a finger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/extras/4a1504fc4f86b6aa2118375de0576a14.avif?t=1768815445\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feel Every Lean \u2014 True Immersion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn natural head tilts into in\u2011game lean. Sneak, peek, and strafe with your body \u2014 no keys required.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for tactical FPS lean mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use hand gestures as commands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural movement that feels right</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with standard webcams</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/extras/ac7cccef31c3df02ddc3a771d2a92ef4.avif?t=1768815445\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Works With Any Game, Any Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From shooters and RPGs to racing and sims \u2014 bind movements to any keys and keep your flow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mods, overlays, or SDKs needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bind to Q/E, or any other key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs alongside your favorite titles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/extras/5f5123802a8670c65066121eee86379b.avif?t=1768815445\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Internet? No Problem.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything runs locally on your PC for minimal latency and maximum reliability \u2014 even offline.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cloud processing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low latency for competitive play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private by design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/extras/1e707b266013a699bf54ba04d8666622.avif?t=1768815445\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plays Nice With Controllers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair Tiltility\u2122 with your controller to free up buttons for more actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplify combos and macros</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >up to 3 keys can be assigned to each gesture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add gestures for quick actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More control without clutter</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058970?t=1768815445","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058970?t=1768815445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/2aac3cccaaf5b51e6fd3e54a9e82e062aad696f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768815445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/2aac3cccaaf5b51e6fd3e54a9e82e062aad696f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768815445","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lean Left, Lean Right\u00a0\u2014\u00a0Without pressing any keys!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiltility\u2122 uses your webcam to